/*
 * Implements validation for `break` expressions in Ymir.
 *
 * A `break` expression exits the nearest enclosing loop. It may carry a value
 * when used inside a `loop` construct, in which case the loop itself becomes a
 * value-producing expression.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::instruction::break_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/instruction/break_.yr
 * @Author(s):
